{"track":"python","category":"기초 문법","level":2,"title":"별 삼각형","desc":"<p><code>*</code>이 1개, 2개, …, <code>n</code>개인 줄을 순서대로 담은 <b>문자열 리스트</b>를 돌려주는 <code>triangle(n)</code>을 만드세요. 예: <code>triangle(3)</code> → <code>[\"*\", \"**\", \"***\"]</code></p>","starter":"def triangle(n):\n    pass\n","solution":"def triangle(n):\n    return [\"*\" * i for i in range(1, n + 1)]\n","hint":"<p>문자열에 정수를 곱하면 반복돼요: <code>\"*\" * 3</code> → <code>\"***\"</code></p>","tests":[{"call":"triangle(3)","expected":["*","**","***"],"visible":true},{"call":"triangle(1)","expected":["*"],"visible":true},{"call":"triangle(0)","expected":[],"visible":false},{"call":"triangle(5)","expected":["*","**","***","****","*****"],"visible":false}],"id":"py-038"}